  "title": "Turkey-Potato Chowder Recipe",
  "description": "Turkey and potato soup doesn't have to be boring! With mixed veggies, a rich and creamy broth, and bacon crumbles, this chowder is a family favorite.",
  "authors": [
    "Campbell's Kitchen"
